<title>CROATIA: TABLE-Croat insurer Zagreb doubles net in 1996.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Croat insurer Zagreb doubles net in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of insurer Osiguranje Zagreb for  calendar 1996. Millions of kuna unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p>					   1996		   1995</p>
<p>    Net profit			 4.35	vs	 2.19</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   5.99	vs	 3.05</p>
<p>    Total income		   175.02	vs	97.30</p>
<p>    Premium income		 169.40	vs	94.30</p>
<p>    Total costs		    169.03	vs	94.25</p>
<p>    Dividend (HRK per share)    17.44	vs	 none</p>
<p>    Total capital		  104.36	vs	62.84</p>
<p>NOTES -- Osiguranje Zagreb was the second biggest insurance firm in  Croatia with a 5.9-percent market share in 1996. State-owned insurer  Croatia Osiguranje held more than 70 percent of the domestic insurance  market. -- Zagreb newsroom, +385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
